WEBVTT

00:06:27.508 --> 00:06:30.386
and the whispers started --

00:06:30.428 --> 00:06:31.804
the stares,

00:06:31.804 --> 00:06:33.722
the smirks, the chuckles.

00:06:34.723 --> 00:06:40.104
To this day, I still have social anxiety
around my experience eight years ago.

00:06:41.897 --> 00:06:43.107
I lost hope.

00:06:44.859 --> 00:06:47.778
Don't worry,
I've had therapy so I'm OK --

00:06:47.778 --> 00:06:48.988
I'm OK now.

00:06:49.029 --> 00:06:50.823
(Laughter)

00:06:50.865 --> 00:06:52.700
(Cheers)

00:06:52.700 --> 00:06:56.829
(Applause)

00:06:56.871 --> 00:06:58.789
But I felt enough is enough:

00:06:58.789 --> 00:07:00.416
I'm a scientist,